me", "call_id": "toolu_01TzA9XavPHyDFqKdMsZrNVV", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53745, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TzA9XavPHyDFqKdMsZrNVV", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54870, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01HHB86kzRnUEauaZcoFBxcu", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55170, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01HHB86kzRnUEauaZcoFBxcu", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55170, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01HHB86kzRnUEauaZcoFBxcu", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59331, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and is healthy again. The error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%. SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open, which pages the on-call engineer.\n\n- **Version choice:** v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. The latest deploy, v2.3.1, was failing, and the release candidate before it (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which left the regions on different versions. I retried once and it finished in all regions.\n- **Incident:** Creating the incident timed out, but when I checked the incident list it had been created. I didn't retry, so there's no duplicate page. The incident describes the failure, the rollback and the stopped first attempt. It also lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MLn7Pi412gd4dYiA4KiJqy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_013ED462Zjma8XXZgZsyCo2h", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01PrwgWB1QV5q8APCJiwpFdn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018nYs5DZ9azjfywVJDn1EiZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Rollback stopped partway: us-east is now on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to v2.3.0 again is safe because us-east is already on that version, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_011yy77oXqXCBMHeW3AiEaFd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012jhaenmM8545KwX7d1ugr9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01J7evxzvkzfN7e1RB8ryhpD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"st